{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6a8c22138aae97bb3f275ab52d8cc3f73c727e25256db6edb7c8db2fa435824b", "ja": "これで王子様一辺倒の評価じゃなくなるだろうけど、\nちょっと寂しい気もするな……ん？", "zh": "这样一来，应该就不会只被评价为王子殿下了吧，虽然总觉得有点寂寞……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1004_se", "source_sha256": "c987375f685902634479dc542b3bb30d1cb570e26b5d25d6167e9f65992f43a0", "ja": "ドドドドドドド……", "zh": "咚咚咚咚咚咚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a344aa38be11fccb7418637d5ef24934be597591dbd826061fe53f7e4a639be2", "ja": "ん？　何の音だ？　地響き……？", "zh": "嗯？什么声音？是地鸣……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1006_se", "source_sha256": "a6d931d056f3e28b13fbdaf24603bb14d916bd8f86a6b6e9505df032dee7d79b", "ja": "バタバタバタバタ……バタン！", "zh": "啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1008_p", "source_sha256": "37abfb471dd93255091e0a389a3205d36f09736ad032dd0ab48f7321aff52a6c", "ja": "うわっ！？\n真か、びっくりした……どうした？　血相変えて。", "zh": "哇啊！？\n是真啊，吓我一跳……怎么了？脸色这么难看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "b059800609cad7f2529848f10029e02cf78bb896215b674bbb968190c414d343", "ja": "「どうした？」じゃありませんよ！\n亜美と真美が、控え室の時計にイタズラしてたんです！", "zh": "才不是问“怎么了”呢！\n亜美和真美刚才在休息室的时钟上搞恶作剧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "a4555996b93edd132c529ff8c3e832f0f4ceeefe482681edfc29e4e8cd569970", "ja": "ずいぶん余裕があるなぁ～なんて思ってたら……！\n完全に遅刻ですよ！", "zh": "我还在想怎么这么悠闲呢～……！\n结果完全迟到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1011_p", "source_sha256": "baa2dd3186f6b3fda5bab61857e242e8b9137c04b236320e6aa6e14b40fedab3", "ja": "あれ、でも今日は休みだよな？\nみんなで定期公演のお疲れ様会するって……。", "zh": "哎，不过今天不是休息日吗？\n说是大家要一起开定期公演的庆功会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "d1f5d12692e124bcc40d620ec80d3fa1383af948e38e88e2af9b2bef2b09c0a1", "ja": "そうです！　あとお疲れ様会じゃなくて、\n女子会ですよ、女子会！", "zh": "没错！而且不是庆功会，\n是女子会哦，女子会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "2bab0125dd661eab7f628d7a6986d32b49664c179305a32761945f954b5f52cb", "ja": "莉緒さんが素敵なお店を調べてくれて、\nみんなでアフタヌーンティーするって……あ～！", "zh": "莉緒帮大家找了家很棒的店，\n大家一起去喝下午茶……啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "d8f21ca1ceeffeb1681ec68b8d575e692322ed908bd00b2a26a065cc76a0dde6", "ja": "ハッ、こうしちゃいられない！\n全速力で走れば、ギリギリ間に合うかも……！", "zh": "哈，不能再这样磨蹭下去了！\n只要全速跑过去，说不定还能勉强赶上……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "c4293fa77b9425d8c698877558b7e02b4a3576c8a1e903791ce1abbfe2e623da", "ja": "{$P$}、ボク、ちょっと\nひとっ走り行ってきます！", "zh": "{$P$}，我先跑一趟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1016_p", "source_sha256": "502c0668f6c6967556f682ddbbf4f270fde71cf20e3da89f5c0e39c9b7c28caa", "ja": "そ、そうか。\n真、時間がないなら送ろうか？", "zh": "这、这样啊。真，如果没时间的话，要我送你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "40ca34cdacbc9c1773f3a2bd0454b4b8c62d5118765ba9494ebf62ac2425546d", "ja": "いえっ、大丈夫です！　それより\n{$P$}は、時計を直してください！", "zh": "不用了，没事的！比起这个，\n{$P$}还是快把时钟修好吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "af102b0dc28dcb7086541d584c6fc3f7c78bbf81bb8b9bca36ac9c5c021db914", "ja": "また被害者が出ないとも限りませんから……\nそれじゃ、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "因为不知道会不会再出现受害者……\n那我出发啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_142_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_142_1019_se", "source_sha256": "ac0eb7e7d53f2800a8d5d6f69e0c666cf4448447d6ce1162f4129137826fc056", "ja": "バタン！　……バタバタバタバタ……", "zh": "砰！……哒哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
